# 📝 TOEIC Part 5 - Day29

## Question 1

If the weather _____ tomorrow, the outdoor event will be canceled.

A. will worsen
B. worsens
C. worsened
D. worsening

Answer: B

→ If + 현재형

---

## Question 2

Unless you _____ the application by Friday, your request cannot be processed.

A. submit
B. will submit
C. submitted
D. submitting

Answer: A

→ unless + 현재형

---

## Question 3

If you follow the instructions, you _____ the task easily.

A. completed
B. completing
C. will complete
D. have completed

Answer: C

→ 주절에는 will + 동사원형

---

## Question 4

Employees may use the facility as long as they _____ the rules.

A. follow
B. will follow
C. followed
D. following

Answer: A

---

## Challenge

If the manager _____ the report today, we will revise it tomorrow.

A. approves
B. will approve
C. approved
D. approving

Answer: A

---

## Key Point

If + 현재형

→ 미래의 조건을 나타낼 수 있다.

주절

→ will + 동사원형

---

## Remember

❌ If it will rain...

✅ If it rains...
